Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.28,0:00:19.33,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.02,0:00:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paradise of the world is a paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take my hand on\Nthe road I'm going to take
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my hand on the road. I'm going
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.98,0:00:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to take my
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.26,0:00:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hand on the road.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.60,0:01:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aru Kunemon and Mamemon searched all\Nover for the legendary Destiny Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.76,0:01:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once they found it, Aru Kunemon\Ncreated Nightmon to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.48,0:01:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But our guy's DNA digiballed, and\Nwe were able to stop him. Meanwhile,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.18,0:01:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon confronted Black War Greymon and\Ntried to convince him to be his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But just as Black War\NGreymon was coming around,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:01:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he got this weird feeling and\Nleft to find the Destiny Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was nothing we could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.60,0:01:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had to watch as Black Mork\NGreymon destroyed the Destiny Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.36,0:02:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this the end of the digital world?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:10.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx120\fscy120\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(313,326)}Today Miyako is in Kyoto
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's miyako is today's miyako!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.92,0:02:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.83,0:02:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finally in Kyoto! Yo, Lee!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.98,0:02:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry or you'll miss the bus!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.37,0:02:23.95,Date,,0,0,0,,{\frz10.85\fscx75\fscy90\pos(340,226)}ODAIBA ELEMENTARY, 6TH YEAR, CLASS A
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.20,0:02:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear Poromon and Izzy,\Nhow's it going, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the second day of our school\Ntrip and we're finally in Kyoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm having a great time with my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a cool place!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the food is fab.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.40,0:02:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poromon, if you're good,\NI'll bring you a souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.34,0:02:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.25,0:02:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ciao for now. Yelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.32,0:02:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to everything\Nyou've just told me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.16,0:02:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this whole mess started when\Nyour digivice changed into a D3.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If my calculations are\Ncorrect, it's all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.18,0:02:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.18,0:02:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The others needed D3s in\Norder to compete with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so their subconscious minds must have\Nsomehow willed their digivices to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I'm not sure Davis\Nhas a subconscious mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As strong as these digivices\Nare, they just weren't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.42,0:03:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.33,0:03:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that also means you must have made a wish\Nfor your digivice to change into a D3.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember making any wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.86,0:03:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I always got the short side\Nof the wishbone from the turkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, it must have\Nbeen your subconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.16,0:03:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We geniuses have pretty big ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the digital world, data\Nis formed into shapes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,usually based on whatever a person\Nhas running through their mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.88,0:03:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kind of like a VCR for the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.72,0:03:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's the reason\Nwhy everyone's clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.98,0:03:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,change every time they go\Ninto the digital world,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.18,0:03:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and why Davis looks the way he does,\Nlike a fighter pilot on a safari.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.16,0:03:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then I must have wished for\Nthat Digimon Emperor outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.66,0:03:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're not perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should read Singvold's\NTheory of Ultimate Brain Power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.18,0:03:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might be able to\Npick up a few pointers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I taught a class on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.30,0:03:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't you think Tesoro's strengthening\Nyour mind was more effective?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.00,0:03:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.50,0:04:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course Gorski's My Brain My\NBuddy is the quintessential masterpiece
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when it comes to exploring the\Ninner workings of the human mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.10,0:04:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've read it a dozen times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.86,0:04:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a bestseller in the school's\Npsychology department bookstore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.48,0:04:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.76,0:04:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I've\Nnever heard of that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.08,0:04:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so ashamed of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.06,0:04:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got an extra copy you can borrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.08,0:04:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, we high IQ types\Ngotta stick together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.54,0:04:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.45,0:04:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of all the other DigiDestined I've met,\Nyou're one of the only ones as smart as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.90,0:04:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Other DigiDestined?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.90,0:04:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.56,0:04:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess no one told you that\Nwe're not the only ones around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.44,0:04:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, there are quite a\Nfew of us all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.70,0:04:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't met them all\Nyet, but I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems that most of us\Nhave one thing in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.96,0:04:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had some kind of\Nencounter with the Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when they invaded the real\Nworld a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now we each have\Nour own Digimon partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.10,0:04:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.26,0:04:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means that I must have, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.10,0:04:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything from that time\Nis still such a blur to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.62,0:05:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Poromon, there's an email here\Nfor you from Yoli on her trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.44,0:05:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.82,0:05:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.73,0:05:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's just really tired\Nbecause he's been here in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.90,0:05:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real world for a couple\Nof days without Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.86,0:05:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know sometimes when Ken's not\Nhere, even my naps make me exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.56,0:05:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli asked me to watch him while\Nshe was on her school trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.06,0:05:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's been three days since she left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've noticed that as each day passes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.02,0:05:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he seems to get more and more\Ntired, and he's not very hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's really got to be bad when he'd rather
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.32,0:05:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sleep than eat a bag of\Nchocolate gummy chews.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.74,0:05:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.65,0:05:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'll just have to\Ntake him to the digital
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.57,0:05:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world so that he can regain his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.68,0:05:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis and the others have already\Ngone on ahead, haven't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.08,0:05:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.04,0:05:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good idea, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things are kind of crazy there\Nnow, so be careful of any warps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.98,0:05:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise me you won't talk\Nto any strange Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.76,0:05:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Izzy, do you think I can ever make\Nup for all the trouble I've caused?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:06:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look, Ken, we all make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.88,0:06:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we first went to the digital world,\NI came up with a bunch of theories.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.60,0:06:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not all of them were exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.22,0:06:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I was only a kid then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.96,0:06:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I eventually realized that you have to\Nhave all the facts before hypothesizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.82,0:06:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to learn everything we\Ncan about the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that somewhere down the road we'll
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be called on again to\Nhelp the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just make sure that this\Ntime we're both totally prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.34,0:06:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you all to meet\Nback here in two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.78,0:06:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.08,0:06:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told my whole family I would\Nbring them back souvenirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.34,0:06:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.25,0:06:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.26,0:06:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now we can see the sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.68,0:06:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me I'm not seeing\Nwhat I think I'm seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:07:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll demolish them all, and once I do,\Nmy suffering will finally come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.90,0:07:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah whatever stop the talking and keep
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.40,0:07:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,destroying I've got a\Ndeadline to meet I haven't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.80,0:07:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,got all day I'm so proud\Nof that boy sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.80,0:07:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just makes me want\Nto cry. Terra-Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.94,0:07:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.85,0:07:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got here too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's warping!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The area is starting to become unbalanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.46,0:07:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw a warp when he\Ndestroyed the other one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.92,0:07:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it was smaller then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like every time Black War\NGreymon destroys one of those stones,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.76,0:07:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the warp just gets bigger and bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.72,0:07:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look what's happening to him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.48,0:07:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Black War Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is everybody standing\Naround like nothing's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.66,0:08:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.32,0:08:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! You...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.26,0:08:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon? Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Apemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.92,0:08:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swing into action and use my mega-bone\Nstick attack to demolish my enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.02,0:08:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to let the others\Nknow what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.72,0:08:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.63,0:09:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are now in Kyoto! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.88,0:09:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having a wonderful time, Yoli!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.06,0:09:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When will you children ever learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.78,0:09:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.69,0:09:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.64,0:09:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, V-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.96,0:09:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fee-mon, Digiball 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fee-mon, Digiball 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AXFFEMON Armadimon Digiball 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AXFFEMON Parrotmon Armored Digiball 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armored Digiball Pegasmon Flying Hope
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.42,0:09:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.04,0:09:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.95,0:09:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.87,0:09:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.26,0:10:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a rehearsal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.44,0:10:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.18,0:10:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just saw something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.58,0:10:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get my agent! Good. There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.64,0:10:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, now what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, good dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Stingmon, do your thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.98,0:10:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.50,0:10:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon! Yoli!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.90,0:10:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.81,0:10:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.42,0:10:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain everything to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.80,0:10:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.84,0:10:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, he's not a Control Spire\NDigimon, so you can't destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.78,0:10:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.54,0:11:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.78,0:11:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Yoli, the\Nrest is up to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.26,0:11:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.26,0:11:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for action.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.28,0:11:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do first?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.44,0:11:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I thought I left you with Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.46,0:11:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a long story. I found her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's over here, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you the girl who called\Nout Digimon before? Uh, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have one more question to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.74,0:11:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a Digimon you're holding, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.90,0:11:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.62,0:11:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.66,0:11:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:11:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Professor Takenuchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.38,0:12:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I teach folklore at the\Nuniversity in Tokyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.02,0:12:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I've been spending the last year doing\Nresearch right here in the city of Kyoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.81,0:12:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Jim, Joe's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm one of the professor's students.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was pre-med and had to study\Neverything from brain surgery to bedpans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.54,0:12:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then I took one class\Nfrom the professor here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I changed my major to ghosts and goblins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My kid brother still wants\Nto be a doctor, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.52,0:12:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Yuli Inui, and I'm in eighth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.78,0:12:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I live in Tokyo, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.40,0:12:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not sure what I'm\Ndoing here. I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My little brother told me all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.80,0:12:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, and I've heard a lot of good things\Nabout you from my daughter as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.50,0:12:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, uh, I guess that means that you're\Nreferring to Joe Kido and Sora Takenouchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.52,0:12:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bullseye! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.00,0:12:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The laser!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.44,0:12:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.98,0:12:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's V-Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.46,0:12:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:12:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.02,0:13:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.72,0:13:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,X-Beamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.30,0:13:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.34,0:13:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.50,0:13:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've studied legends all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.92,0:13:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loch Ness Monster, Bigfoot,\Nthe Bermuda Triangle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.18,0:13:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should see my frequent flyer miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.32,0:13:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I don't spend much time at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.82,0:13:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that's what caused\NSora to be so angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.54,0:13:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then three years ago, she suddenly\Nturned into a whole new person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She and her mother became best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.18,0:13:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought maybe she had a boyfriend or was
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going through one of those teenage things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.92,0:13:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she simply said that she owed\Nit all to her friends, the Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.42,0:13:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her friends, the Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.41,0:13:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her adventures with them forced her to grow\Nup and change her outlook on everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:13:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially the stormy\Nrelationship with her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.26,0:14:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should see them now,\Nshopping every Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.08,0:14:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My credit card's at the limit. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.90,0:14:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, thanks to the Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.72,0:14:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our family is a lot closer now,\Neven though I'm still never around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.34,0:14:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a beautiful story.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.38,0:14:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for sharing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.52,0:14:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I'm getting to see a\NDigimon on a friendly basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.08,0:14:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had a run-in with\Nthem before, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.72,0:14:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When everything happened three years ago,\NI was right in the middle of the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, my brother Joe\Nwas a little more involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.92,0:14:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was sort of helping\Nout from the sidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that I couldn't\Nhave helped them fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's just that I wanted to give the\Nkid a chance to learn on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.06,0:14:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all the cities they could have picked,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.98,0:14:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why did the Digimon start\Nshowing up here in Kyoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.96,0:14:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since Kyoto became the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,residents here feel the city has developed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.98,0:14:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a very strong connection\Nwith animal spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.56,0:14:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.22,0:14:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.13,0:14:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Different animals like raccoons and foxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.08,0:14:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One reason I'm here in Kyoto is to determine\Nif these stories are based on facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.98,0:14:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another reason is there's an outlet mall\Nwhere I can get my socks for half price.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.80,0:14:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:15:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyoto was chosen to be\Nthe capital partly because
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.64,0:15:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the four gods were in\Nharmony surrounding the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.94,0:15:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you heard that story?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.04,0:15:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's quite interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.56,0:15:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, the mountains to the\Nnorth are for Genbu the turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The river to the east is\Nfor Sieryu the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.88,0:15:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lake to the south is\Nfor Suzaku the phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the road to the west\Nis for Byako the tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.06,0:15:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the city was protected\Nby the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had the convenience of a\Nriver and roads nearby,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.18,0:15:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and was open to the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A perfect scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.46,0:15:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.37,0:15:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's also the Spirit Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the fact that there were many\Ntemples built in all four directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.28,0:15:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They believed that without those temples,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would be too easy for the\Nmagical creatures to get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.26,0:15:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.86,0:15:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Creatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.48,0:15:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.12,0:15:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to scare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.64,0:15:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I get a little\Nwrapped up in my own stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.30,0:15:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city has changed a\Nlot since those days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.96,0:15:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyways,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.87,0:15:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what I'm trying to say is that Kyoto is\Nclose to the spirit world, in other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:15:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any world other than our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.68,0:16:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like the digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.66,0:16:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a theory that those Digimon you\Nsaw running around found it easier to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.84,0:16:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,travel to the warp to the digital world to\NKyoto rather than trying to go to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.32,0:16:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to tell me that Digimon\Nare some sort of magical creatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't they? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like they're\Njust a collection of data.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe Digimon are actually legends\Nthat people have spoken of for hundreds
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.04,0:16:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of years and over time have gained a level\Nof consciousness and become a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.28,0:16:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that Digimon may have\Nstarted as data in some old computer,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.82,0:16:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but have since come alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.36,0:16:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like those old legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.46,0:16:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you agree with my theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.38,0:16:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.64,0:16:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.22,0:16:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:16:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.62,0:17:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Oceumon, a warrior Digimon\Nwho can take different shapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.78,0:17:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen him use a Shogun sword attack\Nto make mincemeat out of his enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.20,0:17:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I? Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.06,0:17:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four of mine, Digivolve, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.66,0:17:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.94,0:17:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Hawkmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think Hawkmon will\Nlet me interview him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feather strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.58,0:17:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon, armor Digivolve! Glad to!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.56,0:17:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimental Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pokémon Armor Digivolve, whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digi-o-masters!\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.32,0:17:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve, you're the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:17:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digi-o-masters, Shurimon,\Nthe samurai of sincerity!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.38,0:18:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Double stars!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.34,0:18:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Professor, do you suggest I start\Ntaking notes about what I'm seeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.58,0:18:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind the notes,\Ndrive the car. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.78,0:18:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Professor, do you happen to have\Na laptop computer? Um, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shogun Sword Double Stars!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.90,0:18:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause everything has gone way\Ntoo far. Digital Gate, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.46,0:18:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jureimon, the port is open!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.38,0:18:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jim, close it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.80,0:18:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.52,0:18:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Jim, he didn't vanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.68,0:19:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He returned to the digital\Nworld where he belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.80,0:19:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.62,0:19:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did a good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.16,0:19:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we have to figure out a\Nway to stop Black War Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.66,0:19:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Yoli, something's happening to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.32,0:19:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all returning\Nto the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.56,0:19:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I've got a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.46,0:19:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did they come here to the real world?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.76,0:19:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.90,0:19:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may not make sense to us, but\Nthere must have been a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.28,0:19:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.14,0:19:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was able to open the digiport and\Nsend Mojyamon back to the Digital World.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Tai and the others\Nweren't able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.04,0:19:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.95,0:19:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.96,0:19:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better hurry up and get\Nyou back to your class.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.42,0:19:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, you don't want to miss\Nthe rest of your school trip, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.96,0:19:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.98,0:19:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.12,0:20:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy Mom, let's go! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.86,0:20:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.16,0:20:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for a small\Ntalk with small children.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.78,0:20:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't get too\Ncomfortable if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.70,0:20:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are still five more Destiny Stones\Nout there, and when I destroy them,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.72,0:20:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there goes the Digital World.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.66,0:20:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She won't stop until she finds\Nall of the Destiny Stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.00,0:20:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if she destroys them all...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.06,0:20:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the balance of the Digital\NWorld will be destroyed as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I finally understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.70,0:20:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This must be what Izzy was worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.74,0:20:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the balance of the\Ndigital world is destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.22,0:20:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something terrible is going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.56,0:20:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice meeting you, Yoli,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.90,0:20:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and be sure to say hi to Sora for\Nme when you get back to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.00,0:20:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to Joe, too. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.12,0:20:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to take care of a\Ncouple of small things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.94,0:20:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.84,0:20:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, just a souvenir,\Na very quiet souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.20,0:21:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.69,0:21:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.76,0:21:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Poromon
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.13,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.64,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to be\Nthinking about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.66,0:21:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to connect with my hand.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.06,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.12,0:21:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to drive together.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.66,0:21:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does it make me so big?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.52,0:21:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you always tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.22,0:22:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always tell you how to do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.25,0:22:03.25,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.82,0:22:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always tell you how to do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.25,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.76,0:22:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always tell you how to do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.26,0:22:17.18,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.68,0:22:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.18,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.31,0:23:00.31,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\fscx120\fscy120\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(310,321)}Protect the Holy Points

